Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the morning, Emaye makes coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:10.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can still hear the sound the coffee makes as it roasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Emaye pounds the coffee slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I quietly watch the jebena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,"Wait, it's not time yet," she tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:41.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,When abol comes, the guests taste first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:53.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,When baraka comes, Emaye gives one to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,One coffee, many people, one heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:10.00,End,,0,0,0,,Made with AI
